            "question": "Can Finance trust Raindrop’s AI-driven analytics and forecasts?",
            "answer": "Yes. The agentic AI works from your consolidated spend data and shows the basis for what it surfaces — trends and cost-saving opportunities your team can validate, not black-box numbers you have to take on faith. You keep control of the assumptions and the decisions."
