        "blockType": "featureSplit",
        "headline": "From Visibility to Action",
        "body": "Raindrop helps you go beyond basic reporting with insights that fuel real outcomes:\n• Spot cost drivers and off-contract spend\n• Flag compliance and performance issues early\n• Track process delays and accelerate cycle times\n• Surface strategic savings and sourcing opportunities\nWhether you need answers fast or want to dig deep, Raindrop makes insight accessible to everyone.",
