        "body": "Raindrop Systems has been named to The Hackett Group’s 50 to Watch Procurement Technology List — the analyst-curated list of procurement technology providers reshaping how enterprises buy and manage commitments.\nSpend Matters has also recognized Raindrop Systems as a Customer Favorite for Contract Lifecycle Management, citing the platform’s value beyond technology and its connected approach to source-to-pay.\nWhen the analysts who track this market name us, it’s because customers are reporting outcomes — not because we sponsored a webinar.",
        "imagePosition": "left"
