            "question": "How does Raindrop fit with our existing ERP and finance systems?",
            "answer": "The platform connects through a single, ERP-agnostic API that works in the background of your current ERP, accounting, or commerce system. It doesn't require replacing existing workflows or retraining your team on a new interface just to stay compliant."
