            "question": "What happens when e-invoicing rules change in a country we operate in?",
            "answer": "Rain, Raindrop Systems' AI agent, monitors mandate changes continuously across every connected market. When a rule changes, updates apply through the same no-code activation flow an administrator already knows, not a new IT project or professional-services engagement."
